### Answer key (try first)

*Check your work only after you attempt each item. Show your representation, not only the final number.*

1. Common denominator 15: 5/15 + 3/15 = 8/15.
2. Common denominator 28: 14/28 + 12/28 = 26/28 = 13/14.
3. Common denominator 30: 18/30 + 5/30 = 23/30.
4. Common denominator 24: 20/24 + 3/24 = 23/24.
5. Common denominator 10: 5/10 + 8/10 = 13/10.
6. Common denominator 12: 8/12 + 6/12 = 14/12 = 7/6.

