2. **Error hunt:** A fictional student forgot a label and wrote only “44.” What question should you ask them before accepting the number?

## Independent practice

Complete each item with visible work. Aim for clear diagrams + checked answers.

1. Find 15% of 61 for a discount display at a band concert ticket table. Show a decimal method and a benchmark check (10% or 1%).
2. Find 20% of 80 for a discount display at a youth-group picnic. Show a decimal method and a benchmark check (10% or 1%).
3. Find 25% of 59 for a discount display at a science-fair supply run. Show a decimal method and a benchmark check (10% or 1%).
4. Find 30% of 78 for a discount display at Prosper Prep basketball practice. Show a decimal method and a benchmark check (10% or 1%).
5. Find 35% of 57 for a discount display at a library reading challenge. Show a decimal method and a benchmark check (10% or 1%).
