4. Exponents first: 7^2 = 49. Then ×: 343. Then +/−: 336.
5. Exponents first: 14^2 = 196. Then ×: 1764. Then +/−: 1753.
6. Exponents first: 12^2 = 144. Then ×: 1584. Then +/−: 1573.

