1. Opposite of -5 is 5. |-5| = 5. |1| = 1.
2. Opposite of -12 is 12. |-12| = 12. |1| = 1.
3. Opposite of -11 is 11. |-11| = 11. |2| = 2.
4. Opposite of -12 is 12. |-12| = 12. |-2| = 2.
5. Opposite of -11 is 11. |-11| = 11. |-1| = 1.
6. Opposite of -9 is 9. |-9| = 9. |0| = 0.

