3. 3x + 18 + 2x = 5x + 18; at x=6: 48.
4. 3x + 27 + 2x = 5x + 27; at x=7: 62.
5. 3x + 33 + 2x = 5x + 33; at x=14: 103.
6. 3x + 39 + 2x = 5x + 39; at x=12: 99.

