*Check your work only after you attempt each item. Show your representation, not only the final number.*

1. Valid net uses faces: two 7×7, two 7×11, two 7×11 without overlapping when folded. Invalid: e.g. more than 4 faces in a row that overlap when folded.
2. Valid net uses faces: two 7×11, two 7×12, two 11×12 without overlapping when folded. Invalid: e.g. more than 4 faces in a row that overlap when folded.
