5. Valid net uses faces: two 15×10, two 15×14, two 10×14 without overlapping when folded. Invalid: e.g. more than 4 faces in a row that overlap when folded.
6. Valid net uses faces: two 15×13, two 15×15, two 13×15 without overlapping when folded. Invalid: e.g. more than 4 faces in a row that overlap when folded.

